{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this demo, you get to play the first biome with 3 starter dwarven tribes and 10 perks to choose from.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your minion dwarves love looting treasures but always fail. Now you have tons of enemies to deal with.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your buildings and dwarves wisely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/8e692443bbf6aad7251ff353aa447af7.poster.avif?t=1762469862\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/8e692443bbf6aad7251ff353aa447af7.webm?t=1762469862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/8e692443bbf6aad7251ff353aa447af7.mp4?t=1762469862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which units to keep and upgrade. The clearer your vision, the faster it will come true.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend your castle</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/43ea3a2d5c5c6700e0a5312da89fe10b.poster.avif?t=1762469862\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/43ea3a2d5c5c6700e0a5312da89fe10b.webm?t=1762469862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/43ea3a2d5c5c6700e0a5312da89fe10b.mp4?t=1762469862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use any means to defend your castle walls, dwarven sheilds, or throw dwarves at the problem; sometimes that can work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thousands of units on screen</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/a7d32c91f28be8ba3bb844aeaea7481f.poster.avif?t=1762469862\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/a7d32c91f28be8ba3bb844aeaea7481f.webm?t=1762469862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/a7d32c91f28be8ba3bb844aeaea7481f.mp4?t=1762469862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against thousands of enemies in real time. Can you handle them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your</strong> <strong>economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/d2aa79d572ff0d08e939a5e5e9bb40d7.poster.avif?t=1762469862\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/d2aa79d572ff0d08e939a5e5e9bb40d7.webm?t=1762469862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/d2aa79d572ff0d08e939a5e5e9bb40d7.mp4?t=1762469862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first step for a strong defense is a strong economy. The stronger your economy, the stronger your defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your city and upgrade your economy with mining, farming, and trading.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/e3ad061963032556819906e4163b0017.poster.avif?t=1762469862\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/e3ad061963032556819906e4163b0017.webm?t=1762469862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/e3ad061963032556819906e4163b0017.mp4?t=1762469862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness your enemies weaknesses or just overpower them split your armies between melee and ranged or even baits.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093180?t=1762469862","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093180?t=1762469862","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/500c519b0047c9ecd985b6a9c382eeadbf773f64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762469862","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/500c519b0047c9ecd985b6a9c382eeadbf773f64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762469862","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this demo, you get to play the first biome with 3 starter dwarven tribes and 10 perks to choose from.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your minion dwarves love looting treasures but always fail. Now you have tons of enemies to deal with.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your buildings and dwarves wisely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093180/extras/8e692443bbf6aad7251ff353aa447af7.poster.avif